TI  - Sleep State-Dependent Eeg Spectral Alterations During Obstructive Sleep Apnea in Chronic Traumatic Brain Injury
AU  - T. Truong
AU  - P. K. Huynh
AU  - R. Nakase-Richardson
AU  - T. Q. Le
T2  - 2025 2nd International Conference on Health Science and Technology (ICHST)
JO  - 2025 2nd International Conference on Health Science and Technology (ICHST)
PY  - 2025
SP  - 1
