TI  - Sleep Stages Classification via EEG Signals Using Quadratic Support Vector Machine (SVM) Algorithm
AU  - E. E. Arslan
AU  - A. Seçkinsoy
AU  - M. F. Akşahin
T2  - 2023 Medical Technologies Congress (TIPTEKNO)
JO  - 2023 Medical Technologies Congress (TIPTEKNO)
PY  - 2023
SP  - 1
