TI  - Efficient sleep stage classification based on EEG signals
AU  - K. A. I. Aboalayon
AU  - H. T. Ocbagabir
AU  - M. Faezipour
T2  - IEEE Long Island Systems, Applications and Technology (LISAT) Conference 2014
JO  - IEEE Long Island Systems, Applications and Technology (LISAT) Conference 2014
PY  - 2014
SP  - 1
