TI  - Investigating Brain Connectivity and Regional Statistics from EEG for Early Stage Parkinson's Classification
AU  - A. Sahota
AU  - A. Roguski
AU  - M. W. Jones
AU  - Z. S. Abdallah
AU  - R. Santos-Rodriguez
T2  - 2024 IEEE 34th International Workshop on Machine Learning for Signal Processing (MLSP)
