TI  - Archetypal Analysis for the Characterization of Distinct Patterns in Mouse Sleep Data
AU  - L. Rose
AU  - A. E. J. Wedenborg
AU  - A. N. Zahid
AU  - B. R. Kornum
AU  - M. Mørup
T2  - 2025 47th Annual International Conference of the IEEE Engineering in Medicine and Biology Society (EMBC)
JO  - 2025 47th Annual International Conference of the IEEE Engineering in Medicine and Biology Society (EMBC)
PY  - 2025
SP  - 1
