TI  - BILMB: Design of a hybrid Bio inspired Incremental Learning-based model for analysing effects of Meditation on different Body-parts
AU  - A. A. Tayade
AU  - R. N. Khobragade
AU  - D. S. Datar
T2  - 2023 6th International Conference on Information Systems and Computer Networks (ISCON)
JO  - 2023 6th International Conference on Information Systems and Computer Networks (ISCON)
PY  - 2023
SP  - 1
