TI  - The influence of EEG noise and filtering strategies on feature extraction for neurological applications
AU  - M. Berradi
AU  - Y. B. Youssef
AU  - H. E. Malali
AU  - A. Mouhsen
T2  - 2026 6th International Conference on Innovative Research in Applied Science, Engineering and Technology (IRASET)
