TI  - Low-Dimensional Matrix Discriminant Analysis of EEG Network Connectivity on Riemannian Manifolds for Emotion Recognition
AU  - H. Fang
AU  - M. Wang
AU  - Z. Zhang
AU  - Y. Wang
AU  - Y. Yang
T2  - IEEE Transactions on Cognitive and Developmental Systems
JO  - IEEE Transactions on Cognitive and Developmental Systems
PY  - 2026
VL  - PP
